{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "usermeta": {
    "chapter": 1,
    "advanced": true,
    "idiom": "Proportional symbol map (circle area = park area, colour = share in strictest zones)",
    "data": [
      "data/aus_states.geojson",
      "data/australian_marine_parks.geojson",
      "data/park_summary.csv"
    ],
    "todo": [
      "Run  python scripts/prep_park_summary.py  to create data/park_summary.csv (one row per park). It prints the headline numbers.",
      "Check the title numbers against what the script printed. They were true for the file I tested (61 parks, 48.2% strict, top 3 parks hold 58% of the strict area); if you re-download the data, re-check them.",
      "Strict = IUCN categories Ia, Ib and II (Sanctuary and National Park zones). Say that in the caption, and define it in plain words.",
      "Circle AREA is proportional to park area (not radius). Tiny parks stay visible only because of the outline; mention that small circles are not to scale if anyone asks.",
      "The frame is wide on purpose: it has to include Heard Island (far left) and Macquarie Island (far bottom right). If you crop it, you lose the three biggest strict parks.",
      "Labels show the 7 largest parks, placed just above each circle. If any collide on your screen, nudge them in the lon_lbl calculation (degrees)."
    ]
  },
  "title": {
    "text": "Three remote island parks hold 58% of Australia's strictly protected marine park area",
    "subtitle": [
      "Each circle is a marine park: size = park area, colour = share of the park in the strictest zones (IUCN Ia/II).",
      "Overall, 48% of the 4.2 million km² is strictly protected."
    ]
  },
  "width": 800,
  "height": 560,
  "autosize": "none",
  "padding": { "left": 10, "right": 10, "top": 62, "bottom": 110 },
  "projection": {
    "type": "mercator",
    "center": [
      120,
      -36
    ],
    "scale": 430
  },
  "layer": [
    {
      "data": {
        "graticule": {
          "step": [
            20,
            20
          ]
        }
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "geoshape",
        "filled": false,
        "stroke": "#dde3e6",
        "strokeWidth": 0.6
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "url": "data/aus_states.geojson",
        "format": {
          "property": "features"
        }
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "geoshape",
        "fill": "#eceae3",
        "stroke": "#c9c6bc",
        "strokeWidth": 0.4
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "url": "data/australian_marine_parks.geojson",
        "format": {
          "property": "features"
        }
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "geoshape",
        "fill": "#cfe3ea",
        "stroke": null
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "url": "data/park_summary.csv",
        "format": {
          "parse": {
            "lon": "number",
            "lat": "number",
            "total_km2": "number",
            "strict_km2": "number",
            "pct_strict": "number",
            "n_zones": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "circle",
        "opacity": 0.82,
        "stroke": "#0b2e3f",
        "strokeWidth": 0.9
      },
      "encoding": {
        "longitude": {
          "field": "lon",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "latitude": {
          "field": "lat",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "size": {
          "field": "total_km2",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": "Park area (km²)",
          "scale": {
            "type": "linear",
            "zero": true,
            "range": [
              0,
              6500
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "values": [
              10000,
              100000,
              500000,
              1000000
            ],
            "format": "~s",
            "orient": "bottom",
            "symbolFillColor": "#ffffff",
            "offset": 4
          }
        },
        "color": {
          "field": "pct_strict",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": "Share in strictest zones",
          "scale": {
            "scheme": "teals",
            "domain": [
              0,
              100
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "orient": "bottom",
            "gradientLength": 120,
            "labelExpr": "datum.value + '%'",
            "offset": 4
          }
        },
        "order": {
          "field": "total_km2",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "sort": "descending"
        },
        "tooltip": [
          {
            "field": "park",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Park"
          },
          {
            "field": "network",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Network"
          },
          {
            "field": "total_km2",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "Area (km²)",
            "format": ",.0f"
          },
          {
            "field": "pct_strict",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "In strictest zones (%)",
            "format": ".1f"
          },
          {
            "field": "n_zones",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "Zones"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "url": "data/park_summary.csv",
        "format": {
          "parse": {
            "lon": "number",
            "lat": "number",
            "total_km2": "number",
            "strict_km2": "number",
            "pct_strict": "number",
            "n_zones": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "window": [
            {
              "op": "rank",
              "as": "rnk"
            }
          ],
          "sort": [
            {
              "field": "total_km2",
              "order": "descending"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "filter": "datum.rnk <= 7"
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.park === 'Heard Island and McDonald Islands' ? 'Heard & McDonald Is.' : (datum.park === 'Cocos (Keeling) Islands' ? 'Cocos (Keeling) Is.' : datum.park)",
          "as": "label"
        },
        {
          "calculate": "(sqrt(datum.total_km2 / 989836 * 6500 / PI) + 9) / (430 * PI / 180 / cos(datum.lat * PI / 180))",
          "as": "dlat"
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.lat + datum.dlat",
          "as": "lat_lbl"
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.lon + (datum.park === 'Cocos (Keeling) Islands' ? -5 : (datum.park === 'Christmas Island' ? 5 : (datum.park === 'Heard Island and McDonald Islands' ? 5 : 0)))",
          "as": "lon_lbl"
        }
      ],
      "mark": {
        "type": "text",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "fontWeight": 600,
        "color": "#0b2e3f",
        "baseline": "bottom"
      },
      "encoding": {
        "longitude": {
          "field": "lon_lbl",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "latitude": {
          "field": "lat_lbl",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "text": {
          "field": "label",
          "type": "nominal"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}